    "title": "2nd Bank of Utah Championship brings world's best golfers to Ivins - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By E. George Goold ,\n2 hours ago The first round of the 2025 Bank of Utah Championship tees off at Black Desert Resort on Thursday morning. The only venue in the country to host a PGA Tour and an LPGA Tour event in the same year, Black Desert welcomes 132 players for the four-round, 72-hole championship test set in the black lava rocks of Ivins. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
